      "artifact_text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>ClueTide — Release review build</title>\n<style>\n:root{color-scheme:light;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#142d36;background:#f4f7f6}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}main{max-width:1000px;margin:auto;padding:52px 24px 70px}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid #d5e0dc;padding-bottom:22px}.brand{font-weight:800;font-size:22px}.tag{color:#126c65;background:#e1eeea;border:1px solid #bed9d1;border-radius:20px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:12px}.eyebrow{margin-top:66px;color:#126c65;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.15em;font-size:12px;font-weight:700}h1{max-width:760px;font-size:clamp(40px,7vw,68px);line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:20px 0}p{line-height:1.7;color:#53656c}.intro{max-width:650px;font-size:18px}.flow{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:36px 0 46px}.flow span{padding:12px 15px;border:1px solid #ceddd7;border-radius:8px;background:white;font-size:13px}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}article{border:1px solid #d5e0dc;padding:24px;border-radius:12px;background:white}h2{font-size:18px;margin-top:0}article p{font-size:14px;margin-bottom:0}.source{margin-top:34px;border-top:1px solid #d5e0dc;padding-top:22px}code{overflow-wrap:anywhere;font-size:12px;color:#126c65}footer{margin-top:26px;font-size:12px;color:#53656c}@media(max-width:650px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.eyebrow{margin-top:42px}header{gap:16px}.tag{max-width:145px;text-align:center}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<header><div class=\"brand\">ClueTide</div><span class=\"tag\">Release review build · v1</span></header>\n<div class=\"eyebrow\">Agent Release Witness</div>\n<h1>Approve an exact release.<br>Verify what shipped.</h1>\n<p class=\"intro\">A coding agent prepares the artifact. A designated human approves its exact version. A controlled publisher checks the chain grant, publishes the artifact, and returns a verifiable receipt.</p>\n<div class=\"flow\" aria-label=\"Release workflow\"><span>01 · Package</span><span>02 · Human review</span><span>03 · Start once</span><span>04 · Publish</span><span>05 · Verify</span></div>\n<section class=\"grid\" aria-label=\"Release capabilities\">\n<article><h2>Exact package</h2><p>Keep the built artifact, source reference, test evidence and deadline together. Download the original evidence bundle for independent comparison.</p></article>\n<article><h2>Designated approval</h2><p>Bind approval to a specific version and operation on BOT Mainnet 677. A changed package requires a new version and another approval.</p></article>\n<article><h2>Separate checks</h2><p>Check the chain authorization, the executor's signed statement and the available artifact bytes separately.</p></article>\n</section>\n<div class=\"source\"><p>Product source reference</p><code>1514371d268464c582bc86021792cb63ad062c26</code></div>\n<footer>Evidence stays downloadable. BOT Chain records the commitments.</footer>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>\n"
